Once.

Then again.

Too long the second time.

Not with lust.

Not even with intent.

Just—

curiosity.

That is enough.

Sukuna is behind him before the boy realizes he’s not alone.

The shift is instant.

The air collapses inward.

Leora feels it before she sees it.

Her head turns—

sharp—

just in time to see Sukuna’s hand close around the servant’s throat.

Lifting.

Effortless.

