Leora wakes to movement.

Not beside her.

Outside.

The air feels—

wrong.

Not heavy.

Hollow.

She sits up slowly.

Listens.

There—

A sound.

Soft.

Calling.

Not with voice.

With something deeper.

Something that reaches past the bond.

Past her control.

And into—

her core.

